msgid "**Teleoperation** — VR, isomorphic teleop, and glove-based control"
msgstr "**遥操作** — VR、同构遥操作以及基于手套的控制"

#: ../../source/0-overview/0-index.md:14 4af4cae8e93f429f8c62772e053ffc3d
msgid ""
"**Python Applications** — High-level APIs for data collection and autonomous"
" tasks"
msgstr "**Python 应用** — 用于数据采集与自主任务的高层 API"

#: ../../source/0-overview/0-index.md:15 95f754d2c2c248919c39cc596696bb0a
msgid ""
"**Synthetic data** — Isaac Sim USD → interface → composer → LeRobot "
